	(text "SCL = DUART OP2 (push-pull: the MCP7940N is the only I2C device and does not clock-stretch);\nSDA driven low through Q2 by OP3 (OPR_SET drives the pin LOW, FET inverts again), read back on IP2;\nMFP -> IP3, firmware programs the 1 Hz square wave.  Pull-up values are assumptions, not in griffin.yml."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
